(7453559, 1180163, 59737, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot of stories and experiences in that face.  I really want this to be a tighter crop of just her face cropping at the chin and hairline.  A more square crop at her hairline would also work for me.  That''s a preference I have for these types of images because for me her face is what tells the story.</td>', 'There''s a lot of stories and experiences in that face.  I really want this to be a tighter crop of just her face cropping at the chin and hairline.  A more square crop at her hairline would also work for me.  That''s a preference I have for these types of images because for me her face is what tells the story.', '2016-05-05 22:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
