(7453567, 1180381, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a fun location and an interesting subject.  Personally I think some work in post could have taken this from good to great.  A simple crop to eliminate the bright eye grabber in the upper right and a vignette to bring the attention back to center are a couple of thoughts at first glance.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a fun location and an interesting subject.  Personally I think some work in post could have taken this from good to great.  A simple crop to eliminate the bright eye grabber in the upper right and a vignette to bring the attention back to center are a couple of thoughts at first glance.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2016-05-05 22:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
